  "htmlContent": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Welcome to Letters from Kali</title><style>@media only screen and (max-width:620px){.letter{padding-left:24px!important;padding-right:24px!important}.title{font-size:32px!important}.outer{padding:16px 8px!important}}</style></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#e8dedf;color:#302731\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all\">Writing, spiritual reflection, and room to ask honest questions.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#e8dedf\"><tr><td class=\"outer\" align=\"center\" style=\"padding:40px 16px\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fcf9f4;border-collapse:collapse\">\n<tr><td style=\"height:6px;background:#653c56;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"letter\" style=\"padding:40px 48px 24px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font:11px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;color:#744b65\">WRITING · TAROT · SPIRITUAL REFLECTION</p><p style=\"margin:0;font:32px/1.2 Georgia,serif;color:#302731\">Letters from Kali</p><div style=\"height:1px;background:#d9ccd2;margin:24px 0 28px\"></div><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font:11px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;color:#744b65\">WELCOME TO LETTERS FROM KALI</p><h1 class=\"title\" style=\"margin:0;font:normal 38px/1.15 Georgia,serif;color:#653c56\">A little room to listen.</h1></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"letter\" style=\"padding:0 48px 40px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">Welcome. I’m glad you’re here.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">Letters from Kali brings together writing, tarot, and spiritual reflection: ways of exploring what we notice, the meanings we give it, and the stories we’re living.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">I hold a master’s degree in creative writing from Goddard College and an undergraduate degree in psychology from the University of Tennessee. Writing belongs at the heart of this work—an invitation to observe closely and ask honest questions.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">The intuition guide is sent separately after you confirm your subscription. In the letters that follow, we’ll explore discernment: how to listen to an impression while examining fear, desire, and the need to be certain.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:26px 0;background:#efe5d6;border-left:3px solid #744b65\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font:11px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;color:#744b65\">A MOMENT ON THE PAGE</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">If you’d like a place to begin, take a page and write:</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">One thing I’m carrying right now is…</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">One question I keep returning to is…</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">One thing I’d like to understand more clearly is…</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:28px 0;font:italic 26px/1.4 Georgia,serif;color:#653c56\">You don’t need a finished answer to begin a conversation.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">These emails will also carry invitations to readings, new writing, and gatherings as they take shape. You can unsubscribe whenever you wish.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#494048\">What brought you here? You’re welcome to reply with a few words, a question, or a little of your story.</p><p style=\"margin:26px 0\"><a href=\"https://kalimeister.com/blog\" style=\"font:16px Arial,sans-serif;color:#653c56;text-decoration:underline\">Read the journal</a></p><p style=\"margin:30px 0 0;font:italic 30px Georgia,serif;color:#653c56\">Kali</p></td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"letter\" style=\"padding:26px 48px;background:#f5f0e8;border-top:1px solid #d9ccd2;text-align:center;font:12px/1.8 Arial,sans-serif;color:#655b61\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">Randi Agency</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">11265 Hallett Street, Soddy Daisy, TN 37379</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px\">You&#x27;ve received it because you&#x27;ve subscribed to our newsletter.</p><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0\"><a href=\"{{ unsubscribe }}\" style=\"color:#653c56;text-decoration:underline\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
